Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Documents Management|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Documents Management|
		|pageName|Media Gallery Page|
		|portletName|Media Gallery|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Page add
		|pageName|Media Gallery Page|
	And SitePageNavigator goto Edit Page
		|page|Media Gallery Page|
	And Page edit Page Layout Column
		|columnName|1 Column|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Media Gallery Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Media Gallery|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Media Gallery Page|
	Then MGPortlet configure Show All PG
		|pageName|Media Gallery Page|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Folder
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Media Gallery Page|
	When DMFolder add PG Via MG
		|mgFolderDescription|DM Folder Description|
		|mgFolderName|DM Folder Name|
	Then DMFolder view PG Via MG
		|mgFolderName|DM Folder Name|
Scenario: Add Folder Document
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Media Gallery Page|
	When DMFolder add PG Via MG
		|mgFolderDescription|DM Folder Description|
		|mgFolderName|DM Folder Name|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Media Gallery Page|
	And DMFolder goto PG Via MG
		|mgFolderName|DM Folder Name|
	And DMDocument add PG Via MG
		|mgDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|mgDocumentFile|Document_1.jpg|
		|mgDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Media Gallery Page|
	And DMFolder goto PG Via MG
		|mgFolderName|DM Folder Name|
	Then DMDocument view PG Via MG
		|mgDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
