Scenario: Search Folder Document
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Media Gallery Page|
	When DMFolder add PG Via MG
		|mgFolderDescription|DM Folder Description|
		|mgFolderName|DM Folder Name|
	And DMFolder goto PG Via MG
		|mgFolderName|DM Folder Name|
	And DMDocument add PG Via MG
		|mgDocumentDescription|DM Document Description|
		|mgDocumentFile|Document_1.jpg|
		|mgDocumentTitle|DM Document Title|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Media Gallery Page|
	And Search search PG
		|searchTerm|DM Document Title|
	And Search view Search Result PG
		|searchAssetTitle|DM Document Title|
		|searchAssetType|Document|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Media Gallery Page|
	And Search search PG
		|searchTerm||
	And Search view Search Result PG
		|searchAssetTitle|DM Document Title|
		|searchAssetType|Document|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Media Gallery Page|
	And Search search PG
		|searchTerm|asdf|
	Then Search view Search No PG
		|searchAssetTitle|DM Document Title|
		|searchNoResults|true|
		|searchTerm|asdf|

